* {{R2|Self-Forming Clay}} relic is no longer triggered by the Terminal modifier's max HP loss
* {{R2|Bookmark}} relic now applies its cost reduction to a card retained by a "{{KW2|Retain}} your Hand" effect like {{C2|Equilibrium}}
* {{R2|Snecko Skull}} relic now always triggers before {{R2|Unsettling Lamp}} relic
* Fixed {{P2|Beetle Juice}} potion making {{M2|Vantom}} 's tail appear cut off
* Players can no longer throw the {{P2|Foul Potion}} while the Merchant inventory is open, and using it on the {{2|Merchant}} no longer freezes the game on controller
* Fixed visual errors with the outline of some potion assets
* Fixed broken controller navigation from relics to card rewards after rerolling via {{R2|Driftwood}}, and completing {{R2|Orrery}}'s card selection in the shop no longer also clicks a shop item on controller
* Fixed {{R2|Pantograph}} relic letting {{R2|Red Skull}}'s Strength increase persist after healing you above 50% health, until an attack was played

=== Colorless: ===
* Fixed VFX sometimes failing to appear during the {{BD2|Rolling Boulder}} power effect
* Fixed a softlock when playing {{C2|Anointed}} card with a Draw Pile larger than your hand can hold
* Fixed being able to highlight creatures while the {{C2|Purity}} card selection screen is open

=== Ironclad: ===
* {{C2|Howl from Beyond}} card now plays from the Exhaust pile after you've drawn your hand instead of before
* Fixed {{C2|Anger}} card played by Havoc also Exhausting on play
* Fixed being able to select an upgraded card with {{C2|Armaments}} card if it was added to your hand by {{C2|Largesse|Largesse+}} card
* Not Yet card can no longer be generated via a {{P2|Skill Potion}}
* To avoid infinite-loop softlocks, {{BD2|Hellraiser}} power now plays only 9 cards per turn when all enemies have infinite HP, and properly plays "Strike" cards against infinite-HP enemies

=== Silent: ===
* Fixed being able to skip the {{C2|Survivor}} card discard selection via the peek button
* Fixed {{C2|Fan of Knives}} card VFX not playing
* You can no longer play cards before {{BD2|Tools of the Trade}} power triggers

=== Regent: ===
* {{C2|Bombardment}} card now plays from the Exhaust pile after you've drawn your hand instead of before
* {{C2|I Am Invincible}} card now triggers before you've discarded your hand instead of after
* {{R2|Regalite}} relic no longer gains Block from enemies applying statuses
* {{C2|Summon Forth}} card now puts existing Sovereign Blades into your hand before Forging instead of after
* Fixed not being able to select cards with a controller when you choose your whole hand via {{C2|GUARDS!!!}}

=== Necrobinder: ===
* Fixed a crash when {{KW2|Osty}} dies during a scene transition
* Fixed {{C2|Reave}} card always bottom-decking the {{C2|Soul}} card it creates
* Fixed {{C2|Fetch}} card not glowing gold when drawn by Gambling Chip relic
* Fixed {{C2|Enfeebling Touch}} power causing {{M2|Ceremonial Beast}} to gain {{BD2|Strength}} after you stun it
* {{R2|Funerary Mask}} relic now shuffles {{C2|Soul|Souls}} into the Draw Pile before your hand is drawn

=== Defect: ===
* Fixed {{C2|Beckon}} still damaging the player if combat is ended by Lightning orbs
* Fixed a spacing issue in the {{BD2|Consuming Shadow}} power hovertip
* {{C2|Scrape}} no longer discards cards that cost zero Energy but have a Star cost

=== Multiplayer: ===
* Fixed a crash when using potions in multiplayer due to state divergence
* Fixed state divergences related to event combats, the {{E2|Crystal Sphere}} event, long event option resolution, {{E2|Mad Science}}/{{BD2|Juggling}} cards with mixed combat speeds, and {{C2|Stampede}} + {{C2|Headbutt}} cards
* Fixed player names with brackets (e.g. clan tags) causing errors
* Fixed {{R2|Pael's Legion}} and {{R2|Vambrace}} relics not proccing when the owner applies {{KW2|Block}} to other players
* Fixed occasional black screen when loading into a saved multiplayer combat
* Fixed incorrect cards being shown when obtaining cards at certain events, and {{R2|Orrery}} relic reporting the wrong cards to other players
* Potions are now canceled if targeted on a creature killed by another player
* Corrected Test Subject HP scaling in multiplayer
* {{E2|Dense Vegetation}} can no longer appear if any player has less than 8 HP
* Fixed a softlock using {{R2|Driftwood}} relic on your first run, and a rare softlock loading into a treasure room when a teammate uses a controller
* {{C2|Strangle}} power no longer procs off other players' card plays
* Relics with turn-specific triggers like {{R2|Candelabra}} no longer skip their trigger when another player takes an extra turn with {{R2|Pael's Eye}}
* {{C2|Nightmare}} card VFX no longer plays for all players
* Other players' HP bars no longer go offscreen when resizing the window in settings
* {{C2|Pillar of Creation}}, {{C2|Supermassive}}, and {{C2|Arsenal}} cards now proc for the player who played {{C2|Largesse}} rather than the recipient
* You can no longer buy items at the shop while transitioning rooms, and exiting the {{2|Merchant}} no longer skips history recording for remaining players
* The correct error message is now shown for a Steam multiplayer connection timeout (error 5008), and improved reporting for a rare connection error
* The "Show Multiplayer Drawings" tickbox is now correctly localized
* You can no longer start a loaded multiplayer game with only one person

== PERFORMANCE: ==
* Reduced stuttering when combat effects appear for the first time in a run

== MODDING: ==
* The base game no longer deletes progress from mods that are removed or errored

